Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:09:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: resume MissAV proxy segments with two bounded
 workers

Use the existing MissAV loopback proxy for TS processing, cache completed segments, retry only missing pieces, and mux locally without transcoding. Gate by the exact source name and supported track/manifest shape; other extensions retain their existing downloader. Preserve completed segments on pause and wait for canceled IO before a replacement writes.

Anikku-specific video path; Mihon downloads image pages and Animeko uses a separate mediamp/KMP pipeline. Eight focused tests cover scope isolation, bounded concurrency, resume, failure integrity and cancellation.
